quick google doesn't clear it up for me. So the first step I would take 
is to ensure that you have the capability to do so. Try typing

capabilities()

at an R prompt and see if there is a TRUE under png. If not, you can set 
the dev argument of maQualityPlots() to a device for which you have 
capabilities. If there is a TRUE under png, then you will need to 
furnish the actual code you are running (or better yet, a reproducible 
example, which implies that I or anybody else can try and replicate what 
you have done).

