Hi Tim,

I could add the %ov% operator as a replacement for the old %in%. So you
would write 'peaks %ov% genes' instead of 'peaks %in% genes'. Would just
be a convenience wrapper for 'overlapsAny(peaks, genes)'.

Cheers,
H.

