 Read Depth with Rsamtools?
In-Reply-To: <8F03EABE33EF754EAD003607138708EFA620F1@vmw-excmbd1s07.dhe.duke.edu>
References: <8F03EABE33EF754EAD003607138708EFA61B17@vmw-excmbd1s07.dhe.duke.edu>
