Hi Brian,

affxparser has a function called readCelHeader. 


library(affxparser)
dates<-rep(0,length(files))
for (i in 1:length(files)){
         datheader<-readCelHeader(ff[i])$datheader
          dd<-gsub(".*([0-9]{2,2}/[0-9]{2,2}/[0-9]{2,2}).*","\\1", datheader)
         dates[i]<-dd
         }


Bye
Rob

