A nice shortcut would be to be able to call the VCF() constructor
on the GRanges object returned by getSNPlocs():

   library(SNPlocs.Hsapiens.dbSNP.20120608)
   chr1_snps <- getSNPlocs("ch1", as.GRanges=TRUE)

